  "heading": "\\reals",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{the reals}\\quad\\htmlClass{mlg-title-written}{\\mathbb{R}}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\reals]\nDefines: Rb ::= (R, 0, 1, +, *, -, /, <=, neg(x_))\nabstractly:\nspecifies:\n. R is \\set\n. 0 \"in\" R\n. 1 \"in\" R\n. + is \\binary.operation:on{R}\n. * is \\binary.operation:on{R}\n. - is \\binary.operation:on{R}\n. / is \\binary.operation:on{R}\n. <= is \\total.order:on{R}\n. neg is \\function:on{R}:to{R}\nexpresses:\n. 0 != 1\n. forAll: a, b, c \"in\" R\n  then:\n  . (a + b) + c = a + (b + c)\n  . a + b = b + a\n  . a + 0 = a\n  . (a * b) * c = a * (b * c)\n  . a * b = b * a\n  . a * 1 = a\n  . a * (b + c) = (a * b) + (a * c)\nEnables:\n. capability: x_ \"in\" Rb :-> x_ is \\real\n. view:\n  as: S := R is \\set\nDocumented:\n. called: \"the reals\"\n. written: \"\\mathbb{R}\"\n. description: \"The real numbers $(\\mathbb{R}, 0, 1, +, \\cdot, \\le)$ as a\n                complete ordered field.\"\nId: \"aeec4453-1166-47cd-a5f4-3eed295b3d15\"",
